Package: simplefinr
Type: Package
Title: Query SimpleFIN Server APIs and Parse Financial Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Dan", "Riggi",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides tools for claiming SimpleFIN tokens, querying a
    SimpleFIN server or bridge API, and parsing the JSON response into
    flattened tibbles for accounts, transactions, connections, and errors.
    Implements the SimpleFIN Protocol v2.0.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/andtheWings/simplefinr
BugReports: https://github.com/andtheWings/simplefinr/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    tibble
Suggests:
    keyring,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
